{"about_the_game":"Become a pilot in the world of Mobile Suit Gundam SEED, for the first time available with English localization! Engage in thrilling, action-packed Gundam battles, complete missions, and tune up your newly acquired Mobile Suits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/16430219aa8371ed2e7e985f961d8222.webp?t=1752051633\" width=22 height=13 /></span> <strong> Battle across turbulent times!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/b698e272d35fc4bb704b3aeb04ea80b2.poster.avif?t=1752051633\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/b698e272d35fc4bb704b3aeb04ea80b2.webm?t=1752051633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/b698e272d35fc4bb704b3aeb04ea80b2.mp4?t=1752051633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Relive legendary moments from Mobile Suit Gundam SEED and Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny with enhanced maps and graphics. Choose your faction from Earth Alliance Forces, ZAFT, or the Archangel, and complete missions alongside familiar pilots and Mobile Suits from the series.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/16430219aa8371ed2e7e985f961d8222.webp?t=1752051633\" width=22 height=13 /></span> <strong> Over 100 Mobile Suits!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857740/extras/21a90c2885863d39c04af91aa638d32d.poster.avif?t=1752051633\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c